# ライブ・ア・ライブ (Live A Live, SFC-A07624CD): the signs and kanji of its font, by code as the script has them.
# Kana, digits and capitals follow rules and are not listed (the script has them). The lines before the kanji
# from 1D00 on, and 74 of those kanji, were read in play: the code the game was drawing, and the character that
# came up in the sentence on screen. All 768 kanji (1D00 to 1FFF) were then read off numbered sheets of the
# cartridge's glyphs (`yomikata rom-font`: 0x14AA00 + 24 x the number from 1D00, 16x12 a bit a pixel), once, by
# one reader; the 74 read in play agree with the sheets. They stand in the order of their readings.
